cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, code, locked result files, or reproducibility package, please cite this release and the associated journal article when available. Correspondence: Wenbin Liu."
title: "Leakage-Safe Probe-Assisted Contact Angle Prediction Reproducibility Package, Version 4.1"
type: software
authors:
