license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: "A public v4.1 contact-angle dataset, research codebase, and locked reproducibility package for target-masked probe-assisted prediction. The primary model uses nonnegative NNLS-OWRK surface-energy summaries and physics-residual XGBoost learning under nested source-group validation."
keywords:
  - contact angle
  - wettability
  - surface energy
  - physics-guided learning
  - residual learning
  - leakage-aware validation
  - target-masked probe learning
  - nonnegative least squares

